<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 01:23:56 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>埃隆·马斯克表示，SpaceX 数据中心将碾压竞争对手，因为其火箭科学家就像洋基队“打小联盟球队”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/elon-musk-says-spacex-data-centers-will-crush-competitors-because-having-rocket-scientists-is-like-the-yankees-playing-a-little-league-team/</link><description>马斯克表示，随着竞争对手竞相扩大计算能力，SpaceX 可重复使用火箭背后的火箭科学家使该公司在建设人工智能数据中心方面具有优势。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2206110039-e1785883531724.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 23:37:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/elon-musk-says-spacex-data-centers-will-crush-competitors-because-having-rocket-scientists-is-like-the-yankees-playing-a-little-league-team/</guid></item><item><title>埃隆·马斯克 (Elon Musk) 提出了“完全疯狂”的月球机器人计划，并坚称将实现 1 万亿美元的收入目标，但资本支出使 SpaceX 首次盈利陷入困境</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/elon-musk-spacex-earnings-trillion-revenue-target-capex-stock-reaction/</link><description>这家火箭和人工智能公司公布的收入强于预期，但投资者却因快速增长的资本支出而感到窒息。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2218290768-e1785885326791.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 00:50:11 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/elon-musk-spacex-earnings-trillion-revenue-target-capex-stock-reaction/</guid></item><item><title>从波切蒂诺到美国职业足球大联盟，美国金融巨头不断对美国足球的未来做出重大承诺</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/pochettino-mls-private-equity-hedge-fund-griffin-berg-citadel-apollo/</link><description>肯·格里芬 (Ken Griffin) 为波切蒂诺 (Pochettino) 提供资助直至 2030 年，KKR 支持美国职业足球大联盟 (MLS) 的发展联盟，新任美国职业足球大联盟 (MLS) 专员是阿波罗 (Apollo) 的资深人士。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288942255-e1785879515802.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 23:40:41 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/pochettino-mls-private-equity-hedge-fund-griffin-berg-citadel-apollo/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普会见人工智能巨头，参议院民主党谴责“不可预测”的治理——廉价的中国人工智能隐现出巨大的安全风险</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/trump-ai-regulation-china-national-security/</link><description>虽然民主党人表示，缺乏明确的规则将导致美国公司选择中国人工智能公司而不是国内公司，但专家表示，这是成本问题。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2281424374-e1785871467194.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 21:24:32 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/trump-ai-regulation-china-national-security/</guid></item><item><title>“令人困惑”：白宫不会公开发布今天与 OpenAI、Anthropic、微软等公司一起审查的人工智能模型评估框架</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/baffling-white-house-wont-publicly-release-ai-model-evaluation-framework-it-reviewed-today-with-openai-anthropic-microsoft-and-others/</link><description>目前还不清楚政府为什么要对该框架保密，尤其是在 OpenAI 和 Anthropic 发生一系列让公众感到恐慌的黑客攻击之后。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2287747467-e1785874961989.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 22:53:59 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/baffling-white-house-wont-publicly-release-ai-model-evaluation-framework-it-reviewed-today-with-openai-anthropic-microsoft-and-others/</guid></item><item><title>SpaceX 收入飙升至 78 亿美元，超出华尔街预期近 10 亿美元</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/spacex-revenue-surges-92-to-7-8-billion-blowing-past-wall-street-expectations-by-nearly-1-billion/</link><description>SpaceX 公布的季度收入为 78 亿美元，大幅高于市场预期的 69 亿美元，星链用户数量翻了一番，达到 1200 万，新的人工智能合同价值 141 亿美元，财务业绩大幅提升。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2256971457-e1785873517435.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 20:19:05 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/spacex-revenue-surges-92-to-7-8-billion-blowing-past-wall-street-expectations-by-nearly-1-billion/</guid></item><item><title>多瑙河水位下降，数十艘二战船只暴露在外</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/danube-rivers-shrinking-water-levels-expose-dozens-of-world-war-ii-ships/</link><description>在创纪录的低水位导致欧洲各国政府制定电力短缺计划的情况下，在战争中沉没的德国船只正在重新浮出水面。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2169753199-e1785874688114.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 21:29:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/danube-rivers-shrinking-water-levels-expose-dozens-of-world-war-ii-ships/</guid></item><item><title>欧洲漫长炎热的夏季导致数千人疏散，消防人员死亡</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/europes-long-hot-summer-leads-to-thousands-evacuated-and-fire-operators-dead/</link><description>法国、希腊和英国面临严重的炎热和干燥天气，导致紧急消防行动和干旱状况。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2288162170-e1785873779376.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 21:29:02 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/04/europes-long-hot-summer-leads-to-thousands-evacuated-and-fire-operators-dead/</guid></item><item><title>华尔街隐藏的招聘渠道不是常春藤盟校文凭，而是能让你被录用的几率增加三倍的队友</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/wall-street-recruiting-pipeline-ivy-league-sports-teams-hiring-edge/</link><description>一项针对超过 120,000 名常春藤盟校毕业生的新研究发现，更衣室关系而非文凭才是进入顶级金融公司的真正把关者&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GettyImages-876642784-e1785528266422.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 01 Aug 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/01/wall-street-recruiting-pipeline-ivy-league-sports-teams-hiring-edge/</guid></item><item><title>估值 750 亿美元、全球客户 7500 万、正在进军美国——Revolut 是伦敦的非凡颠覆者</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/07/03/75-billion-valuation-london-america-ipo-francesca-carlesi/</link><description>投资者对 Revolut 下了大注。这家金融科技公司在最新一轮融资中估值达 750 亿美元，目标是在 Nvidia 和软银的支持下进行 2000 亿美元以上的 IPO &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Copy-of-francesca_carlesi_retouch1-e1783073485813.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 03 Jul 2026 10:26:20 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/07/03/75-billion-valuation-london-america-ipo-francesca-carlesi/</guid></item></channel></rss>